00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:52.000
to kind of render that visual YouTube interface.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:57.000
So that app and your phone, we can consider the front end.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.900
Again, because it's that visual interface

